/**Function*************************************************************

  Synopsis    [Runs the stmap61 mapper probe.]

  Description [stmap61 repeats the stmap60 bounded transfer while enabling a
  mapper-side gate diagnostic for near-miss node 23628. The command preserves
  the mode-57 policy and records which cut-only exception predicate blocks the
  formerly useful stmap56 candidate.]

  SideEffects []

